# UPSTREAM_PIN (1ac0f2b9 = tag v0.9.0) is a pure NVIDIA commit, so the NVIDIA
# repo is the canonical remote (P4-1 v0.9.0 re-pin, 2026-07-04). The suharvest
# fork (https://github.com/suharvest/TensorRT-Edge-LLM.git) carries the same
# SHA and works as a fallback. Cross-wall / offline devices: override with
# EDGELLM_UPSTREAM_REMOTE=<local checkout or bundle> (see build.sh).
